            border-radius: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<!-- Chosen Palette: Slate & Cyber Emerald (Dark Mode Modern Hackathon) -->
<!-- Application Structure Plan:
    Designed as a dual-mode interactive presentation & live demo system tailored for hackathon judges:
    1. Navigation / Slide Switcher: Direct jump to key deck sections (Problem, Solution, Circuit Architecture, 3-Lane Math, Dashboard, Animation Sim, City Impact, Innovations).
    2. Interactive Simulator (Animation): HTML Canvas powered animation showing dynamic 3-lane vehicles, predictive lane change logic, eco-deceleration curves, and smart park slot detection.
    3. Hardware Circuit Diagram: Interactive block visualizer showing VEGA ARIES IoT V2 board, IR/Ultrasonic sensors, OLED, Wi-Fi MQTT, and Cloud AI logic.
    4. Data Dashboards & Impact Charts: Chart.js dynamic visualizers comparing traditional driving vs SmartPark AI eco-routing across CO2, fuel savings, and traffic flow capacity.
-->
<!-- Visualization & Content Choices:
    - 3-Lane Traffic Physics -> Interactive Canvas Animation -> Visualizes real-time vehicle shifting and braking without SVG.
    - Hardware Architecture -> Styled Tailwind Flex Grid Cards -> Clarifies sensor-to-cloud telemetry flow cleanly.
    - Macro Impact -> Chart.js Bar & Radar Charts -> Demonstrates pre/post implementation metrics for judges.
    - Math Equations & Bullet Content -> Bold typography cards -> Optimizes crisp reading under short time constraints.
-->
<!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->

