                            <li><strong class="text-white">Real-Time Sensor Array:</strong> IR & Ultrasonic detection feeds vacancy status live over Wi-Fi MQTT.</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Predictive Reservation:</strong> Assigns optimal slot *before* driver enters urban grid.</li>
