                        </div>
                        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 list-disc list-inside">
                            <li><strong class="text-white">3-Lane Predictive Trajectory:</strong> Directs vehicles into optimal lane based on lookahead distance (500m - 1km).</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Optimal Eco-Velocity ($V_{\text{opt}}$):</strong> Dynamic deceleration modeling prevents forced stop-and-go.</li>
                            <li><strong class="text-white">Terrain Physics Compensation:</strong> Throttle-smoothing uphill; Deceleration Fuel Cut-Off (DFCO) downhill.</li>
                        </ul>
